          "kicker": "Tournament stats",
          "heading": "Fiji concede 145 points over three opening Nations Championship losses",
          "body": "Fiji have conceded 145 points in their opening three Nations Championship fixtures. They have scored 49 points across those same three matches. This leaves the side with a points difference of minus 96. Their latest result was a 17-33 defeat against Scotland. Fiji are aiming to rebuild towards their highest-ever world ranking of No. 7, which they achieved in 2023. Their next test is against France."
