        {
          "kicker": "Squad management",
          "heading": "Steve Borthwick faces scrutiny over squad progress under landmark £264m deal",
          "body": "With the 2027 World Cup now only 12 months away, scrutiny has intensified over whether Steve Borthwick’s side is reaping the rewards of the Rugby Football Union’s £264 million investment. The landmark professional game partnership allows Borthwick to award 25 enhanced contracts, providing him with unprecedented control over the conditioning and development of his elite players within the Premiership. While the domestic league continues to thrive under the new financial structure, the national side remains under pressure to convert this strategic autonomy into world-leading results."
        },
