          "kicker": "Form guide",
          "heading": "France sustain momentum as they secure two straight test wins",
          "body": "France head into the final international block of the year on a solid footing, having secured victories in three of their last five matches. The team is currently enjoying a run of two straight wins, most recently producing a convincing 42-15 result against Japan in the July Nations Championship group stage. With three matches played in the tournament so far, Les Bleus will look to build on this recent form when they return to action in November."
        },
