      "sections": [
        {
          "kicker": "Team news",
          "heading": "Ireland women make six changes for Sunday fixture against Japan",
          "body": "Ireland head coach Scott Bemand has reshuffled his side following last weekend's 40-36 defeat by the USA. Béibhinn Parsons, Anna McGann, and Aoibheann Reilly return to the backline, while Eilís Cahill earns her first start in the front row alongside Neve Jones. In the back row, Brittany Hogan is recalled to the starting lineup. Crucially, Aoife Wafer has been ruled out of the contest after sustaining a minor injury in training earlier this week."
        },
