          "kicker": "Legal proceedings",
          "heading": "Men sentenced for murder of former Argentina international Federico Aramburu",
          "body": "A French court has sentenced two men to lengthy prison terms for the 2022 murder of former Argentina international Federico Aramburu in Paris. Loik Le Priol received a 26-year sentence, with the court noting his intent to kill, while associate Romain Bouvier was sentenced to 19 years for attempted murder. Aramburu, who earned 22 caps for Los Pumas, was killed following an altercation near the Boulevard Saint-Germain. The defendants have 10 days to appeal the court's ruling."
        },
