          "kicker": "WXV Global Series",
          "heading": "Australia women defeat Scotland with dominant second-half performance",
          "body": "The Australia women’s side secured a 30-10 victory over Scotland in Edinburgh, overcoming a 10-5 half-time deficit. Following a clinical first half from the hosts, the Wallaroos seized control with three tries in an eight-minute spell after the interval. Scrum-half Samantha Wood, who converted her own try to initiate the turnaround, alongside scorers Desiree Miller, Brianna Hoy and Faitala Moleko, ensured a comfortable win for the visitors. The two sides are scheduled to meet again in Sydney next weekend."
        },
