          "body": "The Sakura XV face Ireland in Galway today, looking to reset after recent international outings. Ireland head coach Scott Bemand acknowledged the challenge, stating that his side is preparing to face a team with a \"certain style of rugby\" as part of their broader World Cup cycle development. Ireland, currently ranked 5th, are targeting a strong response following their loss to the USA. Japan will need to manage the hosts' early momentum, as Ireland have proven particularly potent in opening halves."
